WEBVTT

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.400
I won't lose to my brother!

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:10.520
Mutsumi-chan!

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.750
Go!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.860
Go get 'em get 'em get 'em!

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.750
They're even with each other!

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.430
At this rate, just who will emerge the victor!?

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:01.260
I have to win today so that I can stop Kudou's winning streak!

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.260
You really think I'll let you?

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.660
Can Mutsumi-chan win?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.940
Oh! Kudou launches a counterattack!

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.610
Nice job, Kudou Mutsumi.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.240
I surrender, I surrender!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.650
Kudou wins!

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.450
Well then, let's have the winner say a few words.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.070
I want to thank you all for supporting me.

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.580
Congratulations on her 15th straight win!

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:29.160
Yes!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.320
Mutsumi-chan is amazing!

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.090
Yep, yep.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.040
I Want to Be a Female Pro Wrestler!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.410
Thank you so much, Hadzuki-chan.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.060
You sure can eat.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:52.060
If I don't eat a lot, I won't grow big and strong.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.020
Ya wanna become even stronger?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.320
Yep, it's because I want to become a female pro wrestler.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.990
Eh... A female pro wrestler?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:01.990
Yep!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.670
I think Mutsumi-chan'd be great fer somethin' like that.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.450
Yeah, I hope you can really be one.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.610
Candy Itou grabs Fumita by the legs and is swinging her around!

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.280
This will cause massive damage!

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.930
Good, good!
This will cause massive damage!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.380
Fumita's counterattack!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.380
Watch out!

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.100
And then she's got her in a lock! Oh! Candy's in danger!

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.180
Now, a commercial break.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:32.010
If you collect these specially marked iced Candies,

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.740
you can get my action figure! They are limited, so act fast!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.810
Ow! What are you doing?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:40.110
Candy's pretty popular, but she kind of sucks.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.060
Candy is amazing!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.030
Really? She's so small that she's not fit for pro wrestling.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:51.000
Candy may be small, but she does a lot of training, so she's very strong!

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:52.500
Can Candy Itou get her 35th straight win?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.710
Hey, it's starting!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:59.540
If you can beat me, I'll let you watch all you want.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.540
Let go of me! Let go!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:06.500
Fumita rushes head on with a headlock!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.140
Candy counters! She wrestles her to the ground!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.100
And...!!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.810
Now she's got her!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.570
What happened, what now? The count begins!

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.390
One!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:17.180
Two!

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:17.770
Three!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.780
Candy gets her 35th straight win!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.990
She keeps her title!
She did it! She won, she won, she won!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.660
She just got lucky.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.770
No, Candy is amazing!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.830
Don't turn it off!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.120
Who cares.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:37.540
One day, I will become stronger than my brother.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.740
Mutsumi.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.880
You're her brother, so cut it out.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.470
There's a parcel for you, Mutsumi.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.300
A parcel? What is it?

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.430
It's an action figure of Candy!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:56.440
Yes, yes! I collected so many of those iced Candies!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.450
Why are you so happy?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.400
What's so nice about such a weak person's action figure?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.300
That's not true.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.930
Candy isn't weak.

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.280
Didn't you see her win?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:09.850
I won't let you borrow this if you keep saying that.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:14.250
What? What was that? I'd never borrow that.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.710
Yes, I'll take this to cheer her on next time.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:23.130
Candy, please keep winning, okay?

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:33.560
I will definitely become a pro wrestler someday and fight with you in the arena.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.690
Now, Kotake, you should go and regain your pride.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.520
No way, Kudou's too strong!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.640
Jeez, why will no one fight me?

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.540
Why doesn't the SOS try?

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.080
No way!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.010
I don't think there's anyone willing to challenge Mutsumi-chan anymore.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:57.530
Yeah, they'd just be hurting themselves.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:06:00.540
Kudou's the strongest among the third graders already.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.050
Find a strong upperclassman already.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:07.510
Oh well, then how about the SOS come at me all at once?

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.050
Can we?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.410
Really?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.010
Three against one?

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.950
That's a bit too much.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:15.470
Yeah, really.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.140
We should win with the three of us.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.480
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.400
Let's try it out.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.520
What's wrong?

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.200
You coming or not?

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.900
Mutsumi-chan, three people's a bit much.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.270
It's dangerous, so just cut it out.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:30.460
Don't worry, those three are nothing.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.970
She seems confident.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.700
Maybe we should stop.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.200
I think so too.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.660
You're giving up already?

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.330
N-No, uhm...

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.340
So what are you going to do?

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.120
We'll do it, we'll do it.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.080
Then why are you running away?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.550
We aren't really running away...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.900
If you don't come at me, I'll beat you all senseless!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.640
Okay, let 'em go, Mutsumi-chan.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.860
Aiko-chan, you're pretty strong.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.590
Now's our chance!

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.890
Ah, they ran away.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.320
There's no point in fightin' those wimps.

00:06:59.320 --> 00:06:59.890
I guess so.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.350
Hey, Aiko-chan.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.150
Yes?

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.360
Can you be my practice partner?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:09.320
Ai-chan's pretty athletic, and she's got really strong arms.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.980
Doremi-chan.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:13.710
Hey, do you want to come over?

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.580
Well...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:19.230
If I were as strong as Ai-chan, I'd definitely go.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:20.040
Really?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.500
I've wanted to have a practice partner. Please.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:27.000
Okay, let's give it a try!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.930
Thank you for having us!

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:29.920
Ta-da!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.090
Look, look!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.290
It's Candy Itou's limited edition action figure!

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.510
You actually got it?

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.460
Yes, I sent in all those proofs of purchase.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.620
Who's Candy Itou?

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.990
A rock singer?

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:45.860
Candy Itou is a female pro wrestler. She has 35 straight wins already.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.880
She'll be trying for her 36th straight win next time.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.440
Right?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.110
Hadzuki-chan knows a lot about her!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.320
No kiddin'.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:58.650
I've always been weak, so I can't wrestle.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.290
But I sometimes watch it on TV.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:05.790
I didn't know that there was someone else in our school who watched female pro wrestling.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.250
She must be strong, winning 35 straight times.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:12.220
Yes! She's strong and really cool!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.710
What? She looks kinda short.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:19.930
Yes, she may be short, but she's so strong in her matches!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.310
She's so pretty and yet so strong...

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:29.280
Hey hey, do you want some iced Candies so I can collect the packages?

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:32.050
Eh? Why are you buying more iced Candies?

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:36.520
Well, I also want a sports bag with Candy on it.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.330
Mutsumi-chan is a hardcore fan.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.210
Well, eating iced Candies in a heated room is pretty nice.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.270
There are a lot, so eat up.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.630
I'm fine with one.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.460
Hey, hey.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.170
What, what?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.070
Want to come with me to watch her next match?

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.670
A match? Candy Itou's?

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.920
Yes, she'll be at a nearby gym next week.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.070
Let's all go.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.160
Will that be her 36th straight win?

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:01.840
Yes.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.350
Then I really wanna go see it!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.570
Really?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.240
Yes, I think so.

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:07.610
Hey, Hadzuki-chan, want to come too?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.520
Okay.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.030
Then it's a promise. Once you see her, you'll definitely become a fan.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.180
H-Hello.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.490
Mutsumi, you're back?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.570
Yes.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:22.980
What? You're showing off your Candy action figure?

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.410
That thing looks disgusting, so throw it away already!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.010
Who cares about you?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.010
Mutsumi-chan, you have an older brother?

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.880
Does he not like pro wrestling?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.080
No, he loves it.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.840
But he hates Candy Itou.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:39.550
Well then, why don't you practice with him?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.760
No way.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.380
My brother's too strong.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.620
But ain't a strong partner better?

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.020
I want to become stronger so that I can beat my brother.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:54.240
I want him to stop saying that Candy Itou is weak.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.630
I see.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.700
Then let's get practicin'!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:01.430
We'll start with locks.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.210
Okay!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.630
What!?

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:07.820
You're going to see female pro wrestling?

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:09.630
I can smell it.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.590
Yes, yes, you smell the scent of young, pretty girls, right?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.690
W-W-Wait-Wait-Wait!!

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.270
There must be a Bad Item there!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.800
I think you should bring me along.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:21.760
Jeez...

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:27.510
I see a girl with a nice body in a tight wrestling suit!

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:27.810
Beau-

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:31.310
Can Candy Itou get her 36th straight win?

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.690
Candy! Candy!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.610
Go!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:41.960
Candy does a reverse tombstone piledriver!

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.990
Fumita's feeling it now!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.830
Ah, her shoelace!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.210
Eh?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:48.800
What?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:54.090
Candy's shoelace came off, but she hasn't noticed it yet!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:54.810
This is dangerous!

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:56.880
Candy, your shoelace! Your shoelace!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.550
It's loose!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.000
What is she doin'? Figure it out already!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.260
This is too dangerous!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.440
Her shoelace was her Achilles' heel!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.400
Candy loses! Her 36th straight win is dashed!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:22.870
Candy Itou has been beaten!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:23.910
She lost...

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.140
That's too bad...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.770
Yeah, we tried to warn her by screaming too...

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:32.880
Why didn't she hear us?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.530
She wasn't as strong as I expected.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.050
I thought she had that win in the bag.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.680
But she did have the upper hand during most of it.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.300
She just had bad luck.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.020
Yeah, I guess so.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.720
35 straight wins is amazing too.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.130
Yes!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.020
She just had bad luck today, right?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.390
She'll definitely win next time. Right?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.140
Mutsumi, take a look at this.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:03.700
What is it?

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:07.100
Are you really retiring if you lose your next match?

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:07.660
Yes.

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:10.730
But that's only if I lose.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:15.580
I will definitely win and erase my shame today.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.090
Retire?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.850
Yes, retire.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.610
That's only if she loses!

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:22.490
She said she'd definitely win!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.050
But it's pretty tough, isn't it?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.100
Once you lose once, it's hard to win again.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.410
Did ya see the TV yesterday?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.460
About Candy Itou, right?

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.550
Mutsumi-chan must have been shocked.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:57.720
Kudou, here we go.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:00.840
You said that you can go up against the three of us at once, right?

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.520
We have a deathblow.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:07.530
You might say the deathblow is a deadringer to win.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:10.090
I'm sorry, I'm not in the mood today.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.040
You don't want to go?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.020
Then you lose.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.570
What did you say?

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.480
But it's true.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.200
Kudou's streak ends here!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:22.780
So yeah, that means Kudou is like Candy, about to retire.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.360
Mmhmm, mmhmm!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.050
O-Okay, I'll do it.

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:25.860
I just have to beat you all.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.970
Okay, then let's go.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.330
The SOS special deathblow is...

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.380
From behind...

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.280
We jump...

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.120
Like monkeys.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.000
I don't get it.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.660
Here we go!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.880
All they did is jump on her back. What idiots...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.380
How's this? How's this? How's this? How's this?

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.660
Mutsumi-chan!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.280
Who's doing the count?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.290
One!

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:50.010
Two!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.810
Three!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.540
Kudou Mutsumi loses!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.390
You have to retire now!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.770
Kudou is retiring!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.360
Retire, retire!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.630
Oh no...

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.360
This is too much for her.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:11.850
Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire! Retire!

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.700
Mutsumi-chan!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.270
Mutsumi-chan.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.680
I really lost.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:26.630
Ya went up against three people at once, so ya don't hafta feel bad about losin'.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.180
Yeah! Don't worry about it.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.580
Yeah, you couldn't help it.

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.810
I don't care if I lose.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.270
But if Candy loses, what should I do?

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.380
Candy Itou?

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.720
She said that if she loses the next match, she'll retire.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.680
Candy's next opponent is very strong.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:50.700
If she loses, then she'll really have to retire!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:57.930
Why is she betting her retirement on such a tough opponent?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.390
I don't think anyone really wants her to retire.

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.100
She just has to win!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.670
Yeah, just win!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:07.630
Don't worry about it. Didn't you say she's very strong?

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:11.080
Yeah, she's very strong, so she'll definitely win.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.550
Ya jus' hafta cheer her on.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.560
We'll help you with that, okay?

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.480
Thank you.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.020
Let's cheer for her together.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.120
Okay, let's do it!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:28.310
We'll cheer our hardest for her to win!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:38.480
The match is tomorrow, so we'll show you how Candy Itou-san trains.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:41.870
Candy Itou!

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.830
She seems to have been injured.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.270
That must have hurt.

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:48.340
Why'd she hafta hurt herself at such an important time?

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.300
Will she be all right for tomorrow's match?

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.260
She'll definitely lose her next match.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.580
That's quite the injury she got...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.320
What is it, Ai-chan?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:05.180
Think about it, this whole thing smells fishy.

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:06.610
What about it?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.150
I'm sayin' it could be a Bad Item.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.130
You're right.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.170
This is too coincidental for bad luck.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.470
I see.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:18.080
Then let's bring the Pureleine Computer to the match tomorrow.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.120
Misora City Gymnasium

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.450
Why are you three looking around like that?

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.830
Ahh, it's nothin'.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.110
Ahh, maybe it's that.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.230
Let's go see!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.440
Where are you all going?

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.630
Please get seats for us!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.450
Jeez.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:37.410
I'll cheer for you, so please do your best.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.010
I need to use the restroom.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.490
Let me go tell her.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:45.730
Where's the restroom?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.150
Eh? What's wrong?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.710
I-It's the real...

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:57.160
U-U-Um... Candy-san!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.180
What is it?

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.180
Please don't retire!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.020
I'm not planning to.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.430
But...

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.120
It's only if I lose.

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.090
Only then, will I quit.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:11.550
B-But why must you fight someone so strong?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.050
You have a better chance against weaker opponents.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.270
And you're injured...

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:22.220
I want Candy-san to win!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.180
I don't want you to retire!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:28.610
But that's not a true victory, is it?

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.510
A match is not only about beating the opponent.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.110
A true match is also about beating yourself.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.580
So it has nothing to do with whether the opponent is strong or weak.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.000
But I'm glad that you're thinking about me.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.960
I'll give it my all, so please cheer for me.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.610
So cool!

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:50.080
Amazing!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.420
Anyway, we gotta find the Bad Item!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.170
Oh yeah.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.380
It's not only about beating the opponent.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.680
A true match is also about beating yourself.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.590
Beating yourself...

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.570
Candy Itou, betting her retirement!

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.560
Her opponent is The Crusher who weighs in at 131 kilograms!
(289 pounds)

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.940
Bad Item, Bad Item...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:11.550
Is this it?

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:12.960
No!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.300
How-bout-this?

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.820
No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.030
Ah! It's started!

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:22.940
If Candy doesn't win, her career as a pro wrestler is over!

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:26.200
After waiting a bit, The Crusher gets her in a headlock!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.160
Candy!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.370
But Candy counters!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.040
Double arm suplex!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.810
Ahh! The Crusher bit her!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:37.890
She really bit her!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:45.020
The Crusher is merciless! That looked painful!

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:48.460
This happens in the world of pro wrestling, but that really looked painful!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.400
Don't worry, Candy will win! She'll win!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.400
What should we do?

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.830
It's not here!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.450
What?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.110
Let's check it out!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.080
One!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.800
Doremi-chan, the action figure!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:11.300
Right!

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.510
Candy!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.110
Two!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.380
Oyaji, look at this action figure!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.840
Not that! Not that! You have to show me the match!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:20.260
What are you saying? The circle appeared!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.640
Oh so it did.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.100
This is it!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.240
Let's go!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.100
2.8 seconds! That was close! Candy's right on the wire!

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.860
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.990
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:50.960
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.510
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:01.240
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.260
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.690
Magical Stage!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.740
Come out, Bad Card!

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.470
Doremi-chan!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:41.010
Okay!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.850
Now she should be fine.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.640
Ya dropped this.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.740
Thank you.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:59.110
Candy, please, do it!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.150
Candy, win!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.990
Candy!

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:12.950
One!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.460
Two!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:15.600
Three!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.810
The count is over!

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:20.920
Candy wins!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:24.880
She surpassed her weaknesses and defeated The Crusher!

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.560
Good job, Candy Itou!

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.870
Amazing!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:33.840
Candy really is the strongest!

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:35.910
I've decided.

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:36.810
About what?

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:41.690
I'll definitely become a pro wrestler and fight with Candy!

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:45.080
And I'll beat my brother to a pulp!

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:48.160
Do your best.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:48.800
Yeah!

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.960
I'm sure you can do it!

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.870
Mutsumi-chan ain't gonna retire now!

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:04.840
When we talk about Christmas, we think about Santa.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.800
I want to meet Santa!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.680
Santa only meets good kids.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:09.900
I'm a good kid.

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.540
You only want a lot of presents, right?

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.640
No! I have something I must tell Santa!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:17.200
I must meet him!

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.700
So what is it?

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:20.830
I can't tell a bad kid like you, Doremi.

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.870
Everyone, we're good kids, right?

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:24.960
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:26.360
Save Santa!

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:29.130
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
